    [Doc][Misc] Clarify cudagraph capture sizes and update Qwen3.8 details (#19893)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    This PR updates the documentation for Qwen3.5, Qwen3.6, and Qwen3.8
    models. Specifically, it:
    - Clarifies the description of `\"cudagraph_capture_sizes\"` to specify
    that it represents batch size tiers rather than levels of graph modes,
    and explains how padding works.
    - Updates the Qwen3.8-27B documentation to remove the incorrect
    vision-language model description (since Qwen3.8-27B is a text-only
    model) and adds details on how to configure thinking/reasoning
    parameters.
    - Updates the vLLM-Ascend version reference to `v0.23.0`.\
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No, documentation-only updates are not considered user-facing changes.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Documentation-only update, no testing required.
    
